; The Web Bluetooth spec defines all four bluetooth events but lists only two in its
; BluetoothEvent aggregate, which is the only way generation discovers an event.
; Delete once the spec lists all four and the pinned webref carries it.
; https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/web-bluetooth
BluetoothEvent = (
  bluetooth.RequestDevicePromptUpdated //
  bluetooth.GattConnectionAttempted //
  bluetooth.CharacteristicEventGenerated //
  bluetooth.DescriptorEventGenerated
)
